Representative Nina Milliken of Blue Hill to serve as a member of the House of Representatives from the party holding the largest number of seats in the Legislature;
Representative Steven Bishop of Bucksport to serve as a member of the House of Representatives from the party holding the 2nd largest number of seats in the Legislature;
